WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.866 --> 00:00:12.666
Wow!

2
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.166
- Wow!

3
00:00:24.366 --> 00:00:28.933
Oh! We did it! We really did it!

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.099
Check it out.

5
00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:33.933
- It’s Mega Lucario!
- Pika!

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.800
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

7
00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:40.533
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.133
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

9
00:00:43.199 --> 00:00:46.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

10
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

11
00:00:49.366 --> 00:00:52.366
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

12
00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:55.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

13
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.633
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

14
00:00:58.699 --> 00:01:00.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

15
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

16
00:01:19.166 --> 00:01:21.200
Awesome, Lucario!

17
00:01:21.266 --> 00:01:25.166
Your aura is really strong now! It’s the super-strongest!

18
00:01:25.233 --> 00:01:28.466
Wow, this is it, the thing we’ve been waiting for!

19
00:01:28.533 --> 00:01:30.166
- Pika!
- Awesome!

20
00:01:30.233 --> 00:01:33.000
- Look at you now!
- Congratulations, you two!

21
00:01:33.066 --> 00:01:34.699
You look so strong!

22
00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:39.166
I’m totally in awe. All of that hard work has paid off in a big way!

23
00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:43.933
Thanks a lot! Well, Grandpa? We hung in there and we did it!

24
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.600
It was all worth it, right?

25
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:49.100
Well, wasn’t it?

26
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:53.866
- Pika?
- You know, we feel your aura too, Lucario.

27
00:01:53.933 --> 00:01:58.333
It sure is impressive. The future of the Shalour City Gym is bright.

28
00:01:58.399 --> 00:02:00.399
Yes.

29
00:02:00.466 --> 00:02:03.833
There you go! Lucario Mega Evolved as well.

30
00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:07.566
It’s the thing to do these days. When will you Mega Evolve?

31
00:02:07.633 --> 00:02:10.533
Chill out! I always save the best for last.

32
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.299
Wobbuffet!

33
00:02:16.533 --> 00:02:18.400
-What do you know?

34
00:02:18.466 --> 00:02:20.933
- That breeze feels kind of warm!
- Na-na!

35
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.700
That was Lucario’s aura you felt. It’s being projected out from its body.

36
00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:29.200
That’s amazing! I wonder how much stronger it’s gotten.

37
00:02:29.266 --> 00:02:34.633
I’ve been waiting for someone to ask that! This will make you wonder no more!

38
00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.100
What is it?

39
00:02:36.166 --> 00:02:39.833
The future is now, thanks to science!

40
00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.900
Clemontic Gear on!

41
00:02:41.966 --> 00:02:45.966
This device will shed some light on the power of Mega Evolution!

42
00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:48.733
I call it the Pokémon Power Meter!

43
00:02:48.799 --> 00:02:50.900
Boring, but it says what it does.

44
00:02:50.966 --> 00:02:53.833
What? Hm! Now observe.

45
00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.566
It uses pre-existing Pokémon data as the reference value.

46
00:02:57.633 --> 00:03:03.200
Point it at your subject, then power on! A Pokémon’s power is instantly measured!

47
00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:07.200
It’s a must-have device if you want to keep track of your Pokémon’s development!

48
00:03:07.266 --> 00:03:10.633
Wow, science is so amazing!

49
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.200
I don’t really get it, but it sounds great!

50
00:03:13.266 --> 00:03:16.700
My Mega Lucario might be stronger than your Mega Lucario!

51
00:03:16.766 --> 00:03:19.466
Confident, aren’t we?

52
00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.299
-Pika!

53
00:03:25.366 --> 00:03:28.500
Yeah! You want to try out your new power, right?

54
00:03:28.566 --> 00:03:30.233
I know you do!

55
00:03:30.299 --> 00:03:35.166
Korrina! Let’s have a battle! It’ll be like a preview of our Shalour Gym battle!

56
00:03:35.233 --> 00:03:38.899
Putting our skills to the test? Yup! I’m in!

57
00:03:39.899 --> 00:03:41.399
Pikachu!

58
00:03:41.466 --> 00:03:43.633
Okay, Pikachu, let’s do this!

59
00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.700
Ready, Lucario?

60
00:03:45.766 --> 00:03:49.933
Mega Lucario’s first battle! Watch, Grandfather!

61
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.299
All right! Let’s see how this goes.

62
00:03:58.266 --> 00:04:01.766
Get ready for a taste of Mega Evolution!

63
00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:03.566
Use Bone Rush!

64
00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:07.833
Pikachu, counter it with Iron Tail!

65
00:04:07.899 --> 00:04:11.033
Pikachu!

66
00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.633
Huh? Oh!

67
00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:22.500
- Oh!
- That’s some power!

68
00:04:22.566 --> 00:04:24.433
Pika!

69
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.266
Wow, look at the force of that Bone Rush. Simply incredible!

70
00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:31.466
It’s almost double compared to the reference data!

71
00:04:31.533 --> 00:04:34.000
- Wow! That’s unbelievable!
- Huh?

72
00:04:34.066 --> 00:04:36.833
- Lucario is so powerful!
- Pika, Pika!

73
00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.733
Seems weird for Lucario to miss an attack like that.

74
00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:45.466
Lucario will be able to control its power in no time, then we’ll be unbeatable!

75
00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.933
Don’t worry. You’re not used to your new power yet.

76
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.166
But you will be soon! Remember I totally believe in you!

77
00:04:53.233 --> 00:04:57.166
Pikachu! Let’s show them your speed! It’s time to use Quick Attack!

78
00:04:57.233 --> 00:04:59.666
Pika! Pik, Pik, Pik!

79
00:04:59.733 --> 00:05:03.800
Okay. Use Power-Up Punch!

80
00:05:03.866 --> 00:05:06.000
Pik, Pik, Pik, Pik! Pika!

81
00:05:11.766 --> 00:05:13.500
-Pika!

82
00:05:13.566 --> 00:05:15.000
-Pika...

83
00:05:15.066 --> 00:05:17.500
Pika... Pika...

84
00:05:17.566 --> 00:05:22.300
- What’s the matter? Can’t you keep up?
- Pika... Pik... Pika...

85
00:05:22.366 --> 00:05:26.466
For some reason, my eyes are having trouble keeping up with the action.

86
00:05:26.533 --> 00:05:28.866
Lucario’s swamping Pikachu with speed!

87
00:05:28.933 --> 00:05:32.066
When I Mega Evolve, I’ll swamp both of those losers.

88
00:05:32.133 --> 00:05:33.300
Wobbuffet!

89
00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:35.833
Let’s go!

90
00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:37.566
Pika!

91
00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:41.766
Look at that! It attacked on its own again!

92
00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:44.966
-Awesome! You’re getting the hang of it!

93
00:05:45.033 --> 00:05:49.533
- This is great stuff! Keep up the speed!
- Pikachu! Use Electro Ball!

94
00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:54.233
Pika! Pika, Pika, Pika, Pikachu!

95
00:05:57.166 --> 00:05:59.433
-Use Power-Up Punch!

96
00:06:01.466 --> 00:06:03.200
Pika, Pika!

97
00:06:06.266 --> 00:06:09.200
Pik... Pik... Pika...

98
00:06:09.266 --> 00:06:13.666
- Huh?
- Pik! Pik, Pik! Pika!

99
00:06:13.733 --> 00:06:17.400
- Pikachu, no!
- Lucario’s acting really strangely!

100
00:06:17.466 --> 00:06:19.833
Could this be part of the Mega Evolution effect?

101
00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.366
Gurkinn?

102
00:06:22.433 --> 00:06:25.566
Hey, Lucario?

103
00:06:27.533 --> 00:06:29.400
Oh, no, Pikachu!

104
00:06:31.099 --> 00:06:33.500
Pik... Pik...

105
00:06:35.299 --> 00:06:38.233
No, Lucario! That’s no way to act in a battle!

106
00:06:38.299 --> 00:06:42.733
Oh! Pikachu! Are you all right?

107
00:06:47.933 --> 00:06:49.000
Uh...

108
00:06:49.066 --> 00:06:50.233
Oh...

109
00:06:50.299 --> 00:06:51.733
I knew it!

110
00:06:51.799 --> 00:06:56.799
Stop. Lucario! Listen to me, please! Lucario! Lucario!

111
00:07:05.366 --> 00:07:06.799
Lucario! Don’t do it!

112
00:07:08.266 --> 00:07:12.033
Lucario, stop!

113
00:07:24.266 --> 00:07:26.266
Korrina! Lucario! Enough!

114
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.599
Oh!

115
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.200
- McGinty, please take this.
- Right.

116
00:07:50.266 --> 00:07:53.633
Oh! Lucario!

117
00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.533
What could’ve happened to you? Lucario--

118
00:07:56.599 --> 00:07:59.833
Korrina, let’s get to the Pokémon Center.

119
00:08:01.633 --> 00:08:03.633
Grandfather? Is this...

120
00:08:12.066 --> 00:08:14.200
Who’s that Pokémon?

121
00:08:19.066 --> 00:08:21.233
It’s Wigglytuff!

122
00:08:30.166 --> 00:08:32.633
Wigglytuff!

123
00:08:32.699 --> 00:08:34.033
Pikachu!

124
00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:37.233
- Pikachu!
- Pikachu’s feeling much better now.

125
00:08:37.299 --> 00:08:39.100
Thanks a lot, Nurse Joy!

126
00:08:39.166 --> 00:08:41.633
- I’m so glad you’re all right!
- Pika!

127
00:08:41.699 --> 00:08:43.033
- Huh?
- Na-na!

128
00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:47.866
- Nurse Joy, how’s Lucario?
- Wait just a little bit longer.

129
00:08:47.933 --> 00:08:53.933
Lucario’s completely exhausted, but getting better. Don’t worry!

130
00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.666
Thanks.

131
00:08:55.733 --> 00:08:57.333
Exhaustion is no surprise.

132
00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.266
The power of Mega Evolution can be too much to handle at first.

133
00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:03.666
By power, do you mean its aura?

134
00:09:06.733 --> 00:09:11.733
Ash and Pikachu, I’m so sorry. It got to the point where I didn’t know what to do.

135
00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.933
I think that surprised all of us, but that’s okay.

136
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.100
I’ll tell you something else. It was probably a surprise for Lucario, too.

137
00:09:19.166 --> 00:09:20.266
- Pikachu!
- Mm-hm.

138
00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:25.333
Ash is right. After evolving, this kind of situation happens all the time.

139
00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:29.166
So you shouldn’t think what happened with your Lucario is unusual.

140
00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.300
Look on the bright side! Lucario was able to Mega Evolve!

141
00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:37.066
I know the two of you will work all this out!

142
00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:39.966
- Pikachu!
- You’re right, Ash.

143
00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:44.733
If any Pokémon will be able to control its new power, it’s Lucario!

144
00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.533
Please take good care of Lucario and thanks.

145
00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.366
Right. You can always count on me.

146
00:09:50.433 --> 00:09:52.300
Wigglytuff!

147
00:09:53.333 --> 00:09:57.366
Mega Evolution’s a lot harder than I thought.

148
00:09:57.433 --> 00:10:00.566
That’s exactly why it’s so incredible.

149
00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:05.833
Was your Lucario like that in the beginning too, Grandfather?

150
00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:10.833
In a way. No one gets everything perfect on their first attempt, but still...

151
00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.066
But still? What are you saying?

152
00:10:13.133 --> 00:10:17.233
That battle you had with Ash earlier was hardly worthy of praise.

153
00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.533
Oh. But didn’t you hear what Ash and the others said?

154
00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.800
We’re just getting warmed up!

155
00:10:22.866 --> 00:10:24.433
Huh? Mr. McGinty!

156
00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.666
Sorry to keep you waiting, Gurkinn.

157
00:10:26.733 --> 00:10:28.699
So, is it finished?

158
00:10:28.766 --> 00:10:31.533
Aye and it came out great.

159
00:10:32.733 --> 00:10:37.133
Ah! The Lucarionite! Thanks, Mr. McGinty!

160
00:10:37.199 --> 00:10:39.033
And this is for you, too.

161
00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.533
Thanks so much!

162
00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.266
It’s such a great photo.

163
00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:47.266
And now we have a complete set.

164
00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:49.500
Like the one Grandpa’s Lucario has.

165
00:10:49.566 --> 00:10:52.033
Mr. McGinty, did you make that one, too?

166
00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:56.166
I did and I’m proud of my handiwork.

167
00:11:01.366 --> 00:11:04.866
So what do you think happened to Mega Lucario?

168
00:11:04.933 --> 00:11:08.733
It just Mega Evolved for the first time, so it probably got carried away.

169
00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:11.266
I wonder. What do you think, Ash?

170
00:11:11.333 --> 00:11:15.966
Hm. Well, it did feel like we were up against a completely different Pokémon

171
00:11:16.033 --> 00:11:18.733
- than the last time we had a battle.
- Pikachu!

172
00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.733
Na-na!

173
00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.733
It was a little bit scary to watch.

174
00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.100
Lucario just went a little wild!

175
00:11:26.166 --> 00:11:29.666
Each Pokémon reacts to Mega Evolution in a different way.

176
00:11:29.733 --> 00:11:33.566
Oh, yeah! The other day, we actually met Diantha, the Champion!

177
00:11:33.633 --> 00:11:37.300
I believe Diantha’s Gardevoir also Mega Evolves, correct?

178
00:11:37.366 --> 00:11:39.833
Yeah. We met Mega Gardevoir, too.

179
00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:43.000
They do both Mega Evolve, but Mega Gardevoir seemed

180
00:11:43.066 --> 00:11:45.233
completely different from Mega Lucario.

181
00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:50.466
You’re right. Mega Gardevoir was so elegant, calm and in control.

182
00:11:50.533 --> 00:11:54.033
On the other hand, Mega Lucario became super strong,

183
00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.566
but totally ignored Korrina’s commands!

184
00:11:58.033 --> 00:12:01.833
I wonder, what was happening with Lucario?

185
00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:08.800
I need to find out. When Lucario refused to listen to me, it felt so strange.

186
00:12:08.866 --> 00:12:12.633
It could mean the power of Mega Evolution is simply too strong

187
00:12:12.699 --> 00:12:14.866
for your Lucario to handle.

188
00:12:14.933 --> 00:12:16.166
Too strong?

189
00:12:16.233 --> 00:12:18.800
It’s believed the strength of Lucario’s aura

190
00:12:18.866 --> 00:12:22.000
is heightened to its limit when it Mega Evolves.

191
00:12:22.066 --> 00:12:25.766
During a battle, every nerve in its body is concentrating on battling,

192
00:12:25.833 --> 00:12:28.199
so it’s unable to think about anything else.

193
00:12:28.266 --> 00:12:33.266
That’s why its heightened aura awakens its battling instinct so strongly.

194
00:12:33.333 --> 00:12:36.133
You’re right. That instinct totally took over.

195
00:12:36.199 --> 00:12:41.433
It’s not unheard of for a Mega-Evolved Pokémon to lose control during a battle.

196
00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:45.900
Okay. So you’re saying Korrina needs to figure out how to control that.

197
00:12:45.966 --> 00:12:47.800
- Pika?
- That’s right.

198
00:12:47.866 --> 00:12:52.133
And it’s a power she must make her own as the Shalour Gym Leader.

199
00:12:52.199 --> 00:12:55.000
- Huh?
- Wigglytuff!

200
00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.099
Lucario!

201
00:13:00.166 --> 00:13:03.933
-Thank goodness!

202
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:06.466
It’s feeling much better now.

203
00:13:06.533 --> 00:13:09.000
Thanks so much, Nurse Joy!

204
00:13:09.066 --> 00:13:12.400
How do you feel, okay? You do recognize me, right?

205
00:13:14.833 --> 00:13:17.133
Okay, okay!

206
00:13:17.199 --> 00:13:20.533
- Glad you’re better, Lucario!
- Pika, Pika!

207
00:13:20.599 --> 00:13:22.766
-You look a lot better!

208
00:13:22.833 --> 00:13:27.066
Uh! That’s right. I wanted to give you the Lucarionite.

209
00:13:31.633 --> 00:13:33.133
It looks great on you!

210
00:13:33.199 --> 00:13:36.933
So chic! Trainer and Pokémon wearing the same style!

211
00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.866
- I’m jealous!
- Na-na-na!

212
00:13:38.933 --> 00:13:40.933
So, you all like it?

213
00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.099
Yup! It’s like a good luck charm!

214
00:13:45.166 --> 00:13:47.466
Lucario? Look, we both learned

215
00:13:47.533 --> 00:13:51.033
that mastering Mega Evolution is a whole lot of hard work.

216
00:13:51.099 --> 00:13:54.233
But you know if anyone can do it, we can!

217
00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:58.633
Korrina, please come with me. I think we should have a battle.

218
00:13:58.699 --> 00:14:02.866
Wow, have a battle with us? It’s been so long!

219
00:14:02.933 --> 00:14:06.599
Now, let’s master Mega Evolution this time for sure!

220
00:14:06.666 --> 00:14:12.166
Hm. It appears you don’t understand what Mega Evolution is really about.

221
00:14:12.233 --> 00:14:14.400
Come outside.

222
00:14:14.466 --> 00:14:16.099
Huh?

223
00:14:25.866 --> 00:14:28.699
Of course we know what Mega Evolution’s about!

224
00:14:28.766 --> 00:14:31.800
Let’s show him how strong we’ve become!

225
00:14:31.866 --> 00:14:34.300
This will be a Mega Evolution battle!

226
00:14:34.366 --> 00:14:38.066
All set. Time to Mega Evolve!

227
00:14:47.566 --> 00:14:49.533
And next it’s our turn!

228
00:14:49.599 --> 00:14:51.000
Time to Mega Evolve!

229
00:14:56.566 --> 00:14:59.366
- Awesome. Two Mega Lucario!
- Pika!

230
00:14:59.433 --> 00:15:02.266
Their auras are flying all over the place!

231
00:15:02.333 --> 00:15:04.366
- Watch closely, Ash!
- Huh?

232
00:15:04.433 --> 00:15:08.466
We’ve never ever beaten my grandfather and his Lucario before.

233
00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:12.300
- We never really stood a chance.
- Yeah, I hear you.

234
00:15:12.366 --> 00:15:17.433
But this time you will for sure and control Lucario’s Mega Evolution, too!

235
00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.966
Count on it! Power-Up Punch!

236
00:15:20.033 --> 00:15:24.566
Block with your aura!

237
00:15:25.733 --> 00:15:27.733
It blocked using just its aura!

238
00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:31.300
Gurkinn’s Mega Lucario has complete control over its aura.

239
00:15:31.366 --> 00:15:34.099
The fact is it’s only when a Pokémon and Trainer

240
00:15:34.166 --> 00:15:37.366
are able to truly understand one another that an aura heightened

241
00:15:37.433 --> 00:15:40.566
to its complete and utter limit can be controlled like that.

242
00:15:40.633 --> 00:15:46.800
Come on! Stop treating me like a little kid and battle me seriously!

243
00:15:46.866 --> 00:15:51.199
That’s what we’re doing. This is how Aura Pokémon should be battling!

244
00:15:51.266 --> 00:15:55.400
Now Bone Rush!

245
00:15:55.466 --> 00:16:00.166
All right, use Bone Rush, too!

246
00:16:10.099 --> 00:16:12.099
-Great move, Korrina!

247
00:16:12.166 --> 00:16:15.033
- Pika!
- You’re doing great, Lucario! Keep it up!

248
00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:19.833
Awesome!

249
00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:23.400
It’s best you don’t underestimate us.

250
00:16:24.866 --> 00:16:28.366
All right, then, Aura Sphere!

251
00:16:30.933 --> 00:16:33.000
Use Bone Rush! Crush it!

252
00:16:37.966 --> 00:16:40.199
It’s got more power!

253
00:16:40.266 --> 00:16:42.933
Gurkinn’s Lucario’s aura is just stronger!

254
00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.366
You can do it, Lucario! You’re the strongest, right?

255
00:16:46.433 --> 00:16:49.199
I know you can beat their Aura Sphere!

256
00:16:57.266 --> 00:16:59.699
There’s that look again!

257
00:16:59.766 --> 00:17:04.233
- Lucario! But why?
- So the real battle begins.

258
00:17:06.533 --> 00:17:09.133
Lucario! Can you hear me?

259
00:17:11.566 --> 00:17:13.566
Lucario, Swords Dance!

260
00:17:13.633 --> 00:17:15.766
Oh! Lucario, what are you doing?!

261
00:17:15.833 --> 00:17:18.733
It ignored her command again!

262
00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.500
Stop it, now!

263
00:17:24.166 --> 00:17:26.099
Dodge it with your aura!

264
00:17:29.399 --> 00:17:32.700
- Lucario, listen to me! Bone Rush!
- Aura Sphere!

265
00:17:47.866 --> 00:17:50.033
Our battle’s over.

266
00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:53.233
Ah! Lucario! Lucario, wake up!

267
00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.133
Well done.

268
00:17:57.833 --> 00:18:00.800
- They’ve got a lot of work ahead.
- Mm.

269
00:18:00.866 --> 00:18:03.333
Lucario! Wake up, please!

270
00:18:05.133 --> 00:18:08.700
I’m so glad you’re awake!

271
00:18:08.766 --> 00:18:10.566
Huh?

272
00:18:10.633 --> 00:18:16.933
It’s hard. But why? It Mega Evolved again, but we still couldn’t control it!

273
00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:21.700
I’m afraid the only ones to blame for the lack of change are you two.

274
00:18:21.766 --> 00:18:23.000
Hm?

275
00:18:23.066 --> 00:18:26.733
Now, Lucario, the reason you’re consumed by your aura is

276
00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:30.233
because of your overconfidence with regard to your power.

277
00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:35.000
Attacking excessively without Korrina’s command is nothing short of arrogant!

278
00:18:35.066 --> 00:18:39.066
And, Korrina, because you allow Lucario to do just that,

279
00:18:39.133 --> 00:18:41.600
it shows you don’t truly understand it.

280
00:18:41.666 --> 00:18:45.500
The way things are now, becoming stronger is impossible!

281
00:18:45.566 --> 00:18:48.033
You two have spent too much time together

282
00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:51.466
and because you believe you truly understand each other,

283
00:18:51.533 --> 00:18:55.633
you have unfortunately neglected the training that would make you stronger.

284
00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.000
It’s this sort of immature behavior

285
00:18:58.066 --> 00:19:00.966
that’s unbecoming of the Shalour Gym Leader!

286
00:19:01.033 --> 00:19:04.866
Oh. I don’t get this. I don’t get this at all.

287
00:19:04.933 --> 00:19:06.566
We’ve battled so much.

288
00:19:06.633 --> 00:19:09.633
Why, you fool!!

289
00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:13.366
I order you to go on another training journey!

290
00:19:13.433 --> 00:19:18.500
There’s a Trainer who has guided me since I was young who lives on Pomace Mountain.

291
00:19:18.566 --> 00:19:21.833
This Trainer’s partner is also a Mega-Evolved Pokémon.

292
00:19:21.899 --> 00:19:25.033
I’m certain they will teach you what you need to be able to see

293
00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.700
beyond the surface of Mega Evolution.

294
00:19:27.766 --> 00:19:29.800
Okay.

295
00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:33.966
Korrina, we want to go with you!

296
00:19:34.033 --> 00:19:36.566
- We can train together!
- Pikachu!

297
00:19:36.633 --> 00:19:38.933
It’s here. Pomace Mountain. Found it!

298
00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:42.666
Thanks a lot, Serena. Look on the bright side.

299
00:19:42.733 --> 00:19:45.433
This is all so you guys can become stronger!

300
00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.433
- Pika!
- I know you’re right, Ash.

301
00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.166
I’m sure training will be a lot more fun if you have company!

302
00:19:52.233 --> 00:19:55.600
- I want to go, too!
- So do I! We’ll go together!

303
00:19:55.666 --> 00:19:58.933
I want to beat you guys when you’re both super-strong

304
00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:02.133
and now that Lucario can Mega Evolve, you’ll do it!

305
00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.500
And once you’re there, I’ll challenge you!

306
00:20:04.566 --> 00:20:06.666
But once we master Mega Evolution,

307
00:20:06.733 --> 00:20:09.433
you won’t be able to win a Shalour Gym badge, you know!

308
00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.500
There’s no way we can know that until we have a Gym battle, right?

309
00:20:13.566 --> 00:20:15.200
Pika!

310
00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:20.333
Korrina, Lucario, how will you come to terms with Mega Evolution

311
00:20:20.399 --> 00:20:23.766
and learn to use the power of the aura?

312
00:20:23.833 --> 00:20:26.433
This is a trial that must be overcome!

313
00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.666
Now, go to Pomace Mountain!

314
00:20:31.466 --> 00:20:35.566
And so, Korrina and Lucario set off on a new journey,

315
00:20:35.633 --> 00:20:37.300
complete with a new task.

316
00:20:37.366 --> 00:20:41.133
Just what will they and our heroes gain from their adventures?

317
00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:46.433
More mysteries of Mega Evolution lie ahead, as the journey continues!
